"Your email stays the same and every device has been logged out. Log in again, and change your password if you think someone else had access.":"Email Anda tetap sama dan semua perangkat sudah dikeluarkan. Masuk lagi, dan ubah kata sandi jika menurut Anda ada orang lain yang punya akses.",
